---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import ReturnButton from '../components/ReturnButton';
---

<Layout 
  title="Terms & Conditions | hoGAMEGATA" 
  description="Terms and conditions of service for using hoGAMEGATA, the horror game metadata registry." 
  withSearch={false} 
  withLink={true}
>
  <!-- Content -->
  <main class="flex-1 flex items-center justify-center p-4 sm:p-6 md:p-8 my-8 sm:my-12 pb-24 font-sans">
    <div class="max-w-3xl w-full border border-white/20 bg-[#09090c] p-6 sm:p-10 md:p-12 rounded-xl sm:rounded-2xl shadow-2xl flex flex-col gap-8 relative">
      
      <!-- Top header with Title & Return Button -->
      <div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4 border-b border-white/10 pb-6">
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-1.5">
          <h1 class="font-sans font-bold text-3xl sm:text-4xl text-white tracking-tight leading-tight">
            Terms & Conditions
          </h1>
          <p class="font-sans text-xs sm:text-sm text-neutral-400 font-normal">
            Terms of Service and User Agreement
          </p>
        </div>
        <ReturnButton client:only="react" />
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-8 text-sm sm:text-base text-neutral-300 leading-relaxed font-sans font-normal">
        <p>
          These terms and conditions govern your use of <strong class="text-white">hoGAMEGATA</strong> (also referred to as "the website," "the service," or "we"), operated by <strong class="text-white">aurostron</strong>. By accessing or using the website, you agree to these terms. If you do not agree, please discontinue using the service.
        </p>

        <section class="space-y-3">
          <h2 class="font-sans font-semibold text-lg sm:text-xl text-white tracking-tight">1. Permitted Use</h2>
          <p>
            We grant you a personal, non-exclusive, non-transferable, revocable license to access and browse the catalog for personal, non-commercial informational purposes.
          </p>
          <p>When using the website, you agree not to:</p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2 text-neutral-400">
            <li>Run automated scrapers, crawlers, or extraction scripts against our catalog pages or internal API endpoints without prior written consent.</li>
            <li>Take actions that impose an unreasonable load on our infrastructure or attempt to disrupt service availability.</li>
            <li>Attempt to bypass rate limits, security measures, or access controls.</li>
            <li>Redistribute or republish entire database dumps or bulk metadata collections commercially.</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-3">
          <h2 class="font-sans font-semibold text-lg sm:text-xl text-white tracking-tight">2. Intellectual Property</h2>
          <p>
            The website's original design, source code, user interface, categorization taxonomies, and editorial rating algorithms (including our custom Scare Meter scoring models and fear classification system) are the intellectual property of aurostron and hoGAMEGATA.
          </p>
          <p>
            All third-party video game titles, cover artwork, screenshots, company names, and trademarks displayed in our directory belong to their respective publishers, developers, and rights holders. Their inclusion on hoGAMEGATA is for identification, criticism, and archival purposes.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-3">
          <h2 class="font-sans font-semibold text-lg sm:text-xl text-white tracking-tight">3. Third-Party Storefronts and Links</h2>
          <p>
            hoGAMEGATA is an independent discovery directory and search index. We do not sell video games, take payments, or handle digital fulfillment directly.
          </p>
          <p>
            Links to external platforms (such as Steam, itch.io, GOG, Epic Games Store, and the PlayStation Store) direct you to third-party services. Each storefront operates under its own terms of service, pricing policies, and privacy practices. We are not responsible for transactions, software downloads, pricing changes, or account issues on third-party websites.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-3">
          <h2 class="font-sans font-semibold text-lg sm:text-xl text-white tracking-tight">4. Catalog Information and Accuracy</h2>
          <p>
            We compile game metadata, release dates, system requirements, and price history from public databases, developer submissions, and digital storefront feeds. While we work to keep information fresh and accurate, game details and discounts change frequently. All catalog information is provided on an "as is" and "as available" basis without warranties of completeness or real-time precision.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-3">
          <h2 class="font-sans font-semibold text-lg sm:text-xl text-white tracking-tight">5. Service Changes and Availability</h2>
          <p>
            hoGAMEGATA is a free public resource. We reserve the right to modify, update, suspend, or discontinue any feature, page, or service component at any time without notice. We are not liable for any downtime, interruptions, or temporary loss of access.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-3">
          <h2 class="font-sans font-semibold text-lg sm:text-xl text-white tracking-tight">6. Limitation of Liability</h2>
          <p>
            To the maximum extent permitted by applicable law, hoGAMEGATA, its creator, and maintainers shall not be liable for any direct, indirect, incidental, consequential, or punitive damages arising from your access to or use of the website, including any reliance on catalog information or interactions with linked third-party services. Because this service is provided free of charge, any liability that cannot be excluded by law is limited to zero.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-3">
          <h2 class="font-sans font-semibold text-lg sm:text-xl text-white tracking-tight">7. Updates to These Terms</h2>
          <p>
            We may revise these terms occasionally to reflect changes in our service or legal requirements. When updates occur, we adjust the effective date shown below. Continued use of the website following any changes signifies your agreement to the revised terms.
          </p>
        </section>

        <div class="rounded-lg border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.03] p-4 text-sm font-sans text-neutral-300">
          For questions or concerns regarding these terms, please contact us at <a href="mailto:hello@gamegata.xyz" class="text-white underline hover:text-neutral-200">hello@gamegata.xyz</a>.
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Footer inside card -->
      <div class="border-t border-white/10 pt-6 font-sans text-xs text-neutral-500 flex flex-col sm:flex-row justify-between items-center gap-2 w-full">
        <span>© 2026 hoGAMEGATA Project</span>
        <span>Effective Date: September 2026</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>
